      "report": "Ptl sighted a bunker and brush hut. The ptl advanced into the camp and saw 5 enemy seated round a cooking fire. The enemy saw the ptl and tried to withdraw. The ptl fired SA and M79 and M26 grenades. A sweep located two bodies and 1 springfield rifle. Ptl leader commented that moving through the jungle with 11 men was hard to accomplish, especially with Viet troops.",
