    {
      "id": 4635,
      "url": "/battlemap?incident=4635",
      "dtg": "1971-08-26T16:40:00",
      "why": [
        "last"
      ],
      "role": "led",
      "ledBy": null,
      "operation": "LRRP",
      "task": "Patrol",
      "gridRef": "YS356906",
      "friendlyForce": 9,
      "enemyForce": 5,
      "friendlyKilled": 0,
      "friendlyWounded": 0,
      "enemyKilled": 1,
      "enemyWounded": 0,
      "units": [
        "21 Patrol, 2 SAS Squadron, Special Air Service Regiment"
      ],
      "subUnits": [
        "2-sas-squadron"
      ],
      "report": "YS356906: A SAS PTL ENG 3 EN MOV N. RES WERE 1 VC KIA (BC). CIAWAS 1 PACK, 1 AK47, 2 AK47 MAGS, APPROX 60 7.62MM SHORT RDS, 1 M26 GREN,QTY MISC EATING AND MILITARY EQPT AND A QTY OF DOCS. EN KIA WAS PROBNGUYEN PHOI, A PL LDR, C6, REAR SVCS STAFF, SR4.\n\nWhile the ptl had stopped to establish communications, the ptl 2IC heard movement coming from the creek line and spotted 3 VC following the ptl backtrail. He engaged the first enemy at 5-7m and sprayed the others in the same burst. 3 enemy were contacted and 1 killed. Enemy returned fire with AK47. At the same time the ptl heard movement on the left flank and suppressed the whole area and threw an M26. The ptl then moved forward using fire and movement. 1 AK47 captured.",
      "archivalSource": "AWM95 7-11-19.pdf 2 SAS pg142; AWM103 R723/1/1/3 SAS Contact Rept; Intsum, AWM95 1/4/232.pdf p211"
    }
  ],
